('B', '**CBT for people at risk of psychosis:** in randomized trials (six trials and 800 participants at 6 months), CBT roughly halved the rate of transition to psychosis, with risk ratios of 0.41 to 0.47 from 6 months through 18 to 24 months (Hutton & Taylor, 2014). These trials studied at-risk mental states rather than STPD specifically, but the overlap is substantial.'),
